  originalText: '<b>CONNECT FOUR</b>

    Make a line of four coins horizontally,
    vertically, or diagonally.


    <b>1. PLACE</b>

    X places a coin on an empty
    cell and secretly chooses a direction. Then Y does the same.


    <b>2. CHOOSE</b>

    Move
    one cell up, down, left, or right, or choose Stay. Only the two new coins move.


    <b>3.
    REVEAL</b>

    Both directions are revealed and the coins move together.


    <b>COLLISIONS</b>

    If
    both aim for the same cell, both return to their starting cells. A blocked coin
    stays put. Swapping places is allowed when both coins can move.


    <b>WIN
    OR DRAW</b>

    Four in a row after movement wins. Simultaneous wins, or a full
    board with no winner, are a draw.


    In local play, pass the device after
    choosing your secret direction.'
  fixTags: 1
  forceFix: 0
